<BaseLayout title="Science Communication — Xiaoyue Gao">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Science Communication" title="Making scientific ideas more accessible" introduction="I contribute through public-event organization, prepared hosting, research presentations, and undergraduate mentoring. My goal is to communicate accurately without hiding uncertainty or contribution boundaries." />

  <section class="content-grid shell">
    <div>
      <p class="side-label">Featured event</p>
      <!-- Optional future media: webinar or roundtable screenshot. -->
    </div>
    <article class="prose">
      <p class="meta">Science in Motion · September 19, 2026</p>
      <h2>The Innovation Webinar #218</h2>
      <p class="lede-small"><span lang="zh">AI 望向宇宙与生命</span> · AI Looks Toward the Universe and Life</p>
      <p>As a member of Science in Motion, I volunteered to support a public webinar exploring how AI is shaping research in life science and astronomy.</p>
      <h3>My contribution</h3>
      <p>I helped develop the theme and program flow, communicated with selected speakers and collaborating organizations, introduced Science in Motion, prepared the hosting script, managed transitions, and participated throughout the roundtable. The organization leader handled the primary speaker invitations and presentation slides, while experienced media collaborators provided distribution infrastructure.</p>
      <div class="metric"><strong>432,414</strong><span>Aggregated livestream views across partner distribution channels</span></div>
      <p class="note">The total represents aggregated views, not unique viewers. The established media partner and webinar series brought an existing audience.</p>
      <h3>Reflection</h3>
      <p>The experience showed that I communicate effectively when I can understand the material and prepare a clear structure. Next time, I would confirm roles earlier, communicate more proactively before the event, and prepare more flexible follow-up questions.</p>
      <div class="link-row"><a class="button-link" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OF0vwXi_r0-EJbyzo7RodA">Read event post</a><a class="text-link" href="https://weixin.qq.com/sph/AhuD8h24Vj">Watch main program</a><a class="text-link" href="https://weixin.qq.com/sph/Ajp8ufHsFa">Watch roundtable</a></div>
    </article>
  </section>

