      <h2>Undergraduate research mentoring</h2>
      <div><p>As part of my doctoral training, I supervise undergraduate experimental work, provide protocol guidance, and help define projects that fit the scope of a course or research placement.</p><p>For one project, I helped a student develop a focused question around constructing an overexpression vector and validating expression in cultured cells, then connected the results to a short course paper.</p><p class="note">Student names and unpublished student work are not displayed.</p></div>
